    "scope": "about",
    "key": "hero_eyebrow",
    "text": "Our mission",
    "href": ""
  },
  {
    "scope": "about",
    "key": "hero_h1",
    "text": "We exist to make great architecture accessible to anyone who wants to build.",
    "href": ""
  },
  {
    "scope": "about",
    "key": "hero_sub",
    "text": "Not just for the few who already know an architect — for anyone with a project and a place to build it. A fair price, a qualified professional, a permit that clears.",
    "href": ""
  },
  {
    "scope": "about",
    "key": "vision_kicker",
    "text": "OUR VISION",
    "href": ""
  },
  {
    "scope": "about",
    "key": "vision_heading",
    "text": "To be the place the world goes to build.",
    "href": ""
  },
  {
    "scope": "about",
    "key": "vision_sub",
    "text": "Every renovation, addition, ADU, restaurant and ground-up home starts with a drawing. We want that first step to be the easy one — wherever you are, whatever you're building.",
    "href": ""
  },
  {
    "scope": "about",
    "key": "numbers_heading",
    "text": "The mission, in numbers",
    "href": ""
  },
  {
    "scope": "about",
    "key": "numbers_sub",
    "text": "A nationwide footprint from day one — because access shouldn't wait for us to open one market at a time.",
    "href": ""
  },
  {
    "scope": "about",
    "key": "why_kicker",
    "text": "WHY WE EXIST",
    "href": ""
  },
  {
    "scope": "about",
    "key": "why_heading",
    "text": "A stamped drawing is a legal instrument — and for most people, it's opaque.",
    "href": ""
  },
  {
    "scope": "about",
    "key": "why_body1",
    "text": "You can't see the price, judge who's qualified, or tell if it will clear your city. That opacity turns a home into a gamble for clients — and buries architects in bidding and business development instead of the work they trained for.",
    "href": ""
  },
  {
    "scope": "about",
    "key": "why_body2",
    "text": "We remove it from both sides at once, and put the people who matter back at the center.",
    "href": ""
  },
  {
    "scope": "about",
    "key": "heroes_kicker",
    "text": "WHO THIS IS FOR",
    "href": ""
  },
  {
    "scope": "about",
    "key": "heroes_heading",
    "text": "The client and the architect are the heroes. We're the crew.",
    "href": ""
  },
  {
    "scope": "about",
    "key": "role_kicker",
    "text": "OUR ROLE",
    "href": ""
  },
  {
    "scope": "about",
    "key": "role_heading",
    "text": "We serve the work — quietly, and only where we're useful.",
    "href": ""
  },
  {
    "scope": "about",
    "key": "role_sub",
    "text": "We don't design your building and we don't stamp it. We build the infrastructure that lets the right two people find each other and trust the process.",
    "href": ""
  },
  {
    "scope": "about",
    "key": "closing_heading",
    "text": "Build something. Or help someone build. We'll take care of the rest.",
    "href": ""
  },
